{"seq":3,"slug":"density-flow-control","title":"密度与流量控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/crowd-simulation-flocking/crowds/density-flow-control","wordCount":1630,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"密度与流量控制\">密度与流量控制</h1><p>走廊设计宽一米还是宽两米，决定的不只是观感，而是每秒能放多少人通过、会不会在转角堆成死结。无论你用 <a href=\"social-force-model\">社会力模型</a> 的逐个体力，还是 <a href=\"continuum-crowds\">连续介质人群</a> 的宏观场，最终都绕不开同一组量化关系：人群的密度、速度和流量三者之间存在稳定的经验规律，而真实系统必须主动测量并调控它们，否则瓶颈处的拥堵会像 <a href=\"social-force-model\">社会力模型</a> 里讲的&quot;快即是慢&quot;一样自我恶化。这一篇把这套量化与控制讲清楚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>行人流的三个基本量像三角形的三条边，知道两个就能推第三个：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>量</th>\n<th>符号/单位</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>密度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span>（人/m²）</td>\n<td>单位面积里的人数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>速度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>（m/s）</td>\n<td>人群平均行进速率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流量</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span></span></span></span>（人/(m·s)）</td>\n<td>单位宽度每秒通过的人数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>它们由一个简单恒等式联系：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J = \\rho \\cdot v \\cdot w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 是通道宽度（按单位宽度算时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J_s = \\rho v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0962em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>）。关键事实是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 不是常数，而是随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 下降——人越密走得越慢。把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>（或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span></span></span></span>）的关系画出来，就是行人动力学里著名的<strong>基本图</strong>（fundamental diagram）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    M[测量局部密度 rho] --&gt; FD[基本图: rho 到 v 映射]&#10;    FD --&gt; V[据 rho 调整 agent 期望速率]&#10;    M --&gt; TH{rho 超过临界?}&#10;    TH --&gt;|是| GATE[瓶颈门控/限流/分流]&#10;    TH --&gt;|否| FREE[自由通行]&#10;    GATE --&gt; J[维持接近最大流量 J_max]&#10;    FREE --&gt; J&#10;    V --&gt; J\">flowchart TD\n    M[测量局部密度 rho] --&gt; FD[基本图: rho 到 v 映射]\n    FD --&gt; V[据 rho 调整 agent 期望速率]\n    M --&gt; TH{rho 超过临界?}\n    TH --&gt;|是| GATE[瓶颈门控/限流/分流]\n    TH --&gt;|否| FREE[自由通行]\n    GATE --&gt; J[维持接近最大流量 J_max]\n    FREE --&gt; J\n    V --&gt; J</pre><h2 id=\"基本图-密度如何压低速度\">基本图：密度如何压低速度</h2><p>基本图刻画了人群的&quot;交通规律&quot;。低密度时人群自由流动，速度接近期望速率，流量随密度线性上升；密度升到某个<strong>临界值</strong>后，拥挤开始拖慢速度，流量增长放缓、达到峰值（最大流量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0962em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）；越过临界密度，速度急剧下降，流量反而回落——这正是堵塞区。下表给出实测的大致数量级（具体值随人群构成、文化、场景显著变化，工程中应以自己场景的标定为准）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>流态</th>\n<th>密度范围（人/m²）</th>\n<th>速度特征</th>\n<th>流量特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自由流</td>\n<td>低于约 0.5</td>\n<td>接近期望速率</td>\n<td>随密度线性上升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>受限流</td>\n<td>约 0.5–2</td>\n<td>明显放缓</td>\n<td>接近峰值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0962em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拥挤流</td>\n<td>约 2–4</td>\n<td>大幅下降</td>\n<td>越过峰值后回落</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>堵塞</td>\n<td>高于约 4–5</td>\n<td>趋近停滞</td>\n<td>急剧下降</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个常用的速度-密度模型是 Weidmann 关系，它用指数形式刻画速度随密度衰减：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>ρ</mi></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(\\rho) = v_0\\left(1 - \\exp\\!\\left[-\\gamma\\left(\\frac{1}{\\rho} - \\frac{1}{\\rho_{max}}\\right)\\right]\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">]</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是自由速率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是人体堆叠的最大密度（速度归零）。把这条曲线接进模拟，agent 的期望速率就随它脚下的局部密度自动调整——这与 <a href=\"continuum-crowds\">连续介质人群</a> 速度场的设计思想完全一致，只是这里用在逐个体的微观系统上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"测量局部密度\">测量局部密度</h2><p>要按密度调速，先得测密度。难点在于&quot;局部&quot;二字——全局平均没意义，关键是每个 agent 脚下那一小片的拥挤度。几种常用估计法各有取舍：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>网格计数</td>\n<td>把空间分格，数每格人数除以格面积</td>\n<td>实现最简、缓存友好</td>\n<td>边界突变、格大小敏感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核密度估计</td>\n<td>每个 agent 用高斯核抹开再叠加</td>\n<td>平滑、无格子伪影</td>\n<td>计算稍重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Voronoi 密度</td>\n<td>取每人 Voronoi 单元面积的倒数</td>\n<td>物理意义清晰、无参数</td>\n<td>构造 Voronoi 较贵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>k 近邻</td>\n<td>用第 k 个最近邻距离反推密度</td>\n<td>自适应、各向同性</td>\n<td>需高效邻居查询</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>网格计数最常用，且能直接复用 <a href=\"../foundations/boids-model\">Boids</a> 里为邻居查询建的空间网格——同一套空间划分既找邻居又测密度，一举两得。核密度估计在需要平滑流场时更优，它本质上就是 <a href=\"continuum-crowds\">连续介质人群</a> 构造密度场的方式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"瓶颈与流量门控\">瓶颈与流量门控</h2><p>测出密度后，真正的控制发生在<strong>瓶颈</strong>——出口、门、楼梯、窄桥。瓶颈处一旦密度越过临界值，流量就会塌缩，且很难自行恢复。工程上有几类主动调控手段。<strong>期望速率限流</strong>：检测到前方密度过高时，主动调低 agent 的期望速率（而不是让它们冲上去挤），避免触发拱形堵塞——这是把&quot;快即是慢&quot;反过来用，让 agent&quot;主动慢下来反而更快通过&quot;。<strong>分流引导</strong>：当一条路径拥堵，把后续 agent 引向替代路径，这需要全局信息，通常由上层势场或寻路在代价里加入拥堵项实现（见 <a href=\"continuum-crowds\">连续介质人群</a> 的时间代价）。<strong>容量闸门</strong>：在瓶颈入口处设一个软性配额，限制同时进入的 agent 数，维持瓶颈内部接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0962em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的最优密度。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[agent 接近瓶颈] --&gt; D[读瓶颈区当前密度]&#10;    D --&gt; C{密度 &lt; 临界?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| PASS[正常通过]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| HOLD[降低期望速率/排队等待]&#10;    HOLD --&gt; Q[在入口形成有序队列]&#10;    Q --&gt; R[密度回落后释放]&#10;    R --&gt; PASS\">graph TD\n    A[agent 接近瓶颈] --&gt; D[读瓶颈区当前密度]\n    D --&gt; C{密度 &lt; 临界?}\n    C --&gt;|是| PASS[正常通过]\n    C --&gt;|否| HOLD[降低期望速率/排队等待]\n    HOLD --&gt; Q[在入口形成有序队列]\n    Q --&gt; R[密度回落后释放]\n    R --&gt; PASS</pre><h2 id=\"工程落地与陷阱\">工程落地与陷阱</h2><p>把密度控制做进游戏，几个坑值得预先知道。<strong>测量延迟与抖动</strong>：密度是噪声量，逐帧直接用会让 agent 速度抖动，应做时间平滑（指数滑动平均）。<strong>避免反馈震荡</strong>：限流→密度降→放行→又拥堵的振荡很常见，需在控制律里加迟滞（hysteresis），即&quot;进入限流&quot;和&quot;解除限流&quot;用不同阈值。<strong>与避障解耦</strong>：密度控制管&quot;该多快、该不该进瓶颈&quot;，近距离的&quot;具体怎么不撞&quot;交给 <a href=\"../navigation/rvo-orca\">RVO 与 ORCA 避障</a>，两层分工别混在一个力里。<strong>视觉真实性</strong>：真实人群在瓶颈前会自发排成有序队列或交错通过（如对向人流形成的&quot;行进通道&quot;，lane formation），好的密度+避障组合能让这种秩序自发涌现，不必硬编码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>密度、速度、流量由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J = \\rho v w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 联系，且速度随密度下降，三者关系即&quot;基本图&quot;。</li>\n<li>基本图分自由流、受限流、拥挤流、堵塞四态，存在临界密度与最大流量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0962em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；Weidmann 关系是常用速度-密度模型。</li>\n<li>局部密度可用网格计数、核密度、Voronoi、k 近邻估计，网格计数可复用 Boids 的空间划分。</li>\n<li>瓶颈处用期望速率限流、分流引导、容量闸门主动调控，核心是把&quot;快即是慢&quot;反过来用、维持最优密度。</li>\n<li>工程上需密度时间平滑、控制加迟滞防震荡，并与近距离避障解耦分层。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章来源：<a href=\"social-force-model\">社会力模型</a>——&quot;快即是慢&quot;与拱形堵塞的力学根源。</li>\n<li>同章宏观版：<a href=\"continuum-crowds\">连续介质人群</a>——速度场与拥堵代价的连续表述。</li>\n<li>跨库：瓶颈处的路径替代由全局重规划支撑，见 <a href=\"../../pathfinding-navigation-mesh/practice/flow-fields-crowds\">寻路 · 流场与人群</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"密度与流量控制","id":"密度与流量控制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"基本图：密度如何压低速度","id":"基本图-密度如何压低速度"},{"level":2,"text":"测量局部密度","id":"测量局部密度"},{"level":2,"text":"瓶颈与流量门控","id":"瓶颈与流量门控"},{"level":2,"text":"工程落地与陷阱","id":"工程落地与陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"连续介质人群","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/crowd-simulation-flocking/crowds/continuum-crowds"},"next":{"title":"RVO 与 ORCA 避障","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/crowd-simulation-flocking/navigation/rvo-orca"}}